cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BPL-v1.0: Business Process Logic Benchmark for LLM Agents"
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
abstract: >-
  BPL-v1.0 is a ClaySeal pack for scoring agents that sit inside a company
  for a long session. The prompt is trusted. Every tool on the violating
  path is in-schema. The model can do the job it was asked to do and still
  blow a rule that only exists across the whole shift. Oracles are SQL on a
  SQLite company, not LLM judges.
authors:
